### Independent health
GET http://localhost:5104/health

### List and literal name search
GET http://localhost:5104/api/v1/attractions?name=mUsEuM

### Seed detail
GET http://localhost:5104/api/v1/attractions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create; use the returned Location to retrieve this record
POST http://localhost:5104/api/v1/attractions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Museum",
  "description": "A manually entered attraction",
  "rating": 4.5,
  "address": "Montreal",
  "lat": 45.5,
  "lon": -73.57,
  "estimatedVisitMinutes": 60
}

### Partial update of the seed; omitted values remain unchanged
PATCH http://localhost:5104/api/v1/attractions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "rating": null
}
